The really interesting part

There is a deeper pattern underneath this history:

AI has repeatedly changed what we mean by "intelligence."

First:

Intelligence = rules

Then:

Intelligence = learning

Then:

Intelligence = representation + prediction

Then:

Intelligence = generation

And increasingly:

Intelligence = reasoning + planning + acting

That last transition may be the biggest one yet.
